id: DRAFT-ndpi-5-ac-config-files-generated-header-install
trigger_tool: conan|cmake|make
phase: compile
error_signature: fatal error: 'ndpi_define\.h' file not found|ndpi_main\.h:32.*ndpi_define\.h
severity: 3
category: autotools, build-system, headers, ohos
match_keywords: compile_error, hmbs_repair_method, ac_config_files, generated_header
title: AC_CONFIG_FILES生成的公共头未被install时在package中补装通过真机编译门禁
root_cause: 上游src/lib/Makefile.in的install规则只find top_srcdir下src/include/*.h，而ndpi_define.h由AC_CONFIG_FILES在top_builddir生成，源树仅有ndpi_define.h.in，导致包内缺失被ndpi_main.h无条件quote-include的同目录头
affected_scope: autotools配方out-of-source构建且AC_CONFIG_FILES生成公共头但install规则只拷贝top_srcdir头文件的C库
verification_cmd: 真机conan create的test_package编译通过且上游make check显示executed 2 passed 2
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: package-install-generated-header
rec_description: 在package末尾补装构建树生成的公共头到package/include/ndpi，找不到则抛错，构建私有的ndpi_config.h保持不发布
rec_command: conanfile.py新增_install_generated_headers并在package末尾调用，优先取build树src/include/ndpi_define.h并walk兜底拷贝到package/include/ndpi/ndpi_define.h
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: patch-install-rule-to-include-builddir
fallback_description: 若生成头位置随构建变异，则补丁上游install规则使其同时安装top_builddir生成的头
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: 'ndpi_define\.h' file not found
forbid_1_reason: 禁止放任缺失生成头继续打包，消费者quote-include必编译失败
forbid_1_consequence: test_package报ndpi_define.h file not found，真机compile门禁compiler_error不通过
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-ndpi-5-ac-config-files-generated-header-install.md
last_updated: 2026-09-16
source_event: ndpi/5真机预检test_package缺ndpi_define.h编译失败并在package补装后通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 10399
